hadiths[9]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1051","[AI-translation] Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne jhagarnay walay ka shor apne hujray ke darwazay par suna, to bahar niklay aur farmaya ke main bashar, insaan, hun aur mere paas koi muqaddama wala aata hai aur mumkin hai ke un mein se aik doosray se behtar baat karta ho, aur main samjhun ke ye sacha hai aur us ke muwafiq faisla kar dun to jis ko main kisi Musalman ka haq dila dun wo angaray ka aik tukra hai, wo chahay us ko le le ya chhor de. (Muslim: 5/129). Baab: Sakht jhagralu."
"1052","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Sab mardon mein bura Allah Taala ke nazdeek wo mard hai jo bara laraka jhagralu ho. (Muslim: 8/57). Baab: Muddaa-alaih par qasam se faisla. (Alad se murad sakht jhagarnay wala hai.)"
"1053","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar logon ko wo kuch dila diya jaye jis ka wo daawa karein, to baaz doosron ki jaan aur maal le lein ge. Lekin muddaa-alaih ko qasam khana chahiye. (Muslim: 5/128). Baab: Qasam aur gawah se faisla."
"1054","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aik qasam aur aik gawah par faisla kiya. Ye us soorat mein hai jab do gawah na hon. Aik gawah ho to muddai saath qasam khaye. (Muslim: 5/128). Baab: Qazi ghussay mein faisla na karay. (Kataba se murad main katib tha; Ubaidullah us ka bhai tha.)"
"1055","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Abu Bakra kehtay hain ke mere baap ne Ubaidullah bin Abu Bakra jo ke Sijistan ke qazi thay ko likhwaya aur main ne likha ke tum do aadmiyon ke darmiyan tum us waqt faisla mat karo jab tak tum ghussay mein ho, kyunke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna hai, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke koi aadmi do shakhson ke darmiyan us waqt faisla na karay, jab wo ghussay ki haalat mein ho. (Muslim: 5/132). Baab: Jab haakim ijtihad karay to sahih ho ya ghalat."
"1056","[AI-translation] Amr bin Aas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko ye farmatay hue suna ke jab haakim soch kar koshish se faisla karay phir sahih karay to us ke liye do ajar hain aur jo soch kar faisla de aur ghalti kar baithay to us ke liye aik ajar hai. (Muslim: 5/131)"
"1057","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hain ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke do aurtein apne apne bachay liye ja rahi thin ke itnay mein bheriya aaya aur aik ka bacha le gaya. Aik ne doosri se kaha ke tera beta le gaya. Aur doosri ne kaha ke tera beta le gaya hai. Aakhir donon apna faisla karanay ko Dawood (alaihissalam) ke paas aayein. Unhon ne bacha bari aurat ko dila diya, is wajah se ke bacha us ke mushabah ho ga ya un ki shariat mein aisi soorat mein baray ko tarjeeh ho gi ya bacha us ke haath mein ho ga. Phir wo donon Sulaiman (alaihissalam) ke paas aayein aur un se sab haal bayan kiya. Unhon ne kaha ke chhuri lao ham bachay ke do tukray kar ke tum donon ko de dein ge, is se bachay ka kaatna maqsood na tha balke haqeeqi maan ka daryaft karna manzoor tha, to choti ne kaha ke Allah Taala tujh par reham karay aisa mat kar wo bari ka beta hai. Sulaiman (alaihissalam) ne wo bacha choti ko dila diya, to Sulaiman (alaihissalam) ne Dawood (alaihissalam) ke khilaf hukm diya, is liye ke donon mujtahid thay aur paighambar bhi thay aur mujtahid ko doosray mujtahid ka khilaf durust hai. Masail-e-ijtihadi mein koi hukm torna durust nahi magar shayad Dawood (alaihissalam) ne us faisla ko qata na kiya ho ga ya sirf bataur-e-fatwa ke ho ga. Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke us hadees mein main ne usi din sakeen ka lafz suna hai jo chhuri ko kehtay hain warna ham to mudya kaha kartay thay. (Muslim: 5/133). Baab: Behtar gawah."
"1058","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aik shakhs ne doosray shakhs se zameen khareedi, phir jis ne zameen khareedi thi us ne sonay ka aik matka, bartan, us mein paya. Khareednay wala, baichnay walay se, kehnay laga ke tu apna sona le le, main ne tujh se zameen khareedi thi, sona nahi khareeda tha. Aur baichnay walay ne kaha ke main ne tere haath zameen aur jo kuch us mein tha baicha tha, to sona bhi tera hai. SubhanAllah baaye aur mushtari donon kaisay khush niyyat aur imandaar thay. Rawi kehta hai ke phir donon ne aik shakhs se faisla chaha, wo bola ke tumhari aulad hai? Aik ne kaha ke mera aik larka hai aur doosray ne kaha ke meri aik larki hai. Us ne kaha ke acha us ke larkay ka nikah us ki larki se kar do aur us sonay ko donon par kharch karo aur Allah Taala ki raah mein bhi do. Gharz sulah kara di aur ye mustahab hai taake donon khush rahein. (Muslim: 5/133). Baab: Khair. (Aqaar se murad zameen hai.)"
"1059","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Khalid Juhani (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ke main tum ko batlaun ke behtar gawah kaun hai? Jo gawahi ke liye bulaye janay se pehle apni gawahi ada kar de. (Muslim: 5/133)"
